    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>No Aimed Shots.</strong> Loads only <strong>2nd Amendment Blind Box Magazines</strong>, and comes fully loaded. Each Attack fires a random round: once you declare the Attack and roll, the GM rolls on the <strong>Blind Box</strong> table (below). <strong>Junk Ammo</strong> makes the gun roll a Malfunction. A <strong>Critical Success</strong> fires <strong>GACHA! Ammunition</strong>, whatever the table says. A <strong>Critical Failure</strong> misfires: it fires Junk Ammo, jams, and rolls <strong>two</strong> Malfunctions.</p><p><em>Born of a marketing campaign for 2nd Amendment, BudgetArms' new brick-and-mortar store: a line of pistols. Results may vary...</em></p><p><strong>Class:</strong> Exotic Poor Quality Medium Pistol • POWER<br><strong>Range table:</strong> Pistol<br><strong>Damage:</strong> 2d6<br><strong>Built-in:</strong> Power Rebuild</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Weapons</small></p>"
